= (v_{i+1} - v_i)/dt = (x_{i+2} - 2x_{i+1} + x_i)/dt^2$.                        
The model is $a_i = c_1 v_i + c_2 x_i + c_3 x_i^3 + c_4 u_i + c_5$.             
$(x_{i+2} - 2x_{i+1} + x_i)/dt^2 = c_1 (x_{i+1}-x_i)/dt + c_2 x_i + c_3 x_i^3 + 
c_4 u_i + c_5$.                                                                 
This can be rewritten as:                                                       
$x_{i+2} = 2x_{i+1} - x_i + dt \cdot c_1 (x_{i+1}-x_i) + dt^2 (c_2 x_i + c_3    
x_i^3 + c_4 u_i + c_5)$.                                                        
$x_{i+2} = (2 + dt \cdot c_1) x_{i+1} + (-1 - dt \cdot c_1 + dt^2 \cdot c_2) x_i
+ (dt^2 \cdot c_3) x_i^3 + (dt^2 \cdot c_4) u_i + (dt^2 \cdot c_5)$.            
                                                                                
